{"about":["Experience Wild Arms™: 4 originally released on the PlayStation®2 console, enhanced with up-rendering, rewind, quick save, and custom video filters.","Their meeting was fate. Filgaia, a world left in ruins by a brutal war, stands still. Ten years have passed since peace was won — yet true healing has never come. Now, on these scarred lands, a new journey begins.","This title has been converted from the PlayStation®2 version to the PlayStation®4 and PlayStation®5 consoles and provides newly added features. Consequently, there may be times where the title plays differently from the PlayStation®2 version, or where some features may cause the title to not function properly. This version does not support the PlayStation®2 console’s peripherals, therefore some functionality may not be available.","Uses DUALSHOCK 4 vibration function","Offline single player","Remote Play allows users to connect to and play games on their PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5 using a mobile device, PC, or another PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5.","Software subject to license (us.playstation.com/softwarelicense)."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202604/1020/32284ca0210035ea17fdd692f75d7eea11d9184d9f2adba0.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202604/1020/32284ca0210035ea17fdd692f75d7eea11d9184d9f2adba0.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202604/1020/7aaadd9c5679c4c17879c85e16559db3e670520c1bc524ea.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202604/1020/7aaadd9c5679c4c17879c85e16559db3e670520c1bc524ea.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202604/1020/7e9adceb626eb0eeccd5eeed4007c5b4463305268e94dfd1.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202604/1020/7e9adceb626eb0eeccd5eeed4007c5b4463305268e94dfd1.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playst